==Battleground==
*8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**8 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Red EnerG]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Dolphina]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

